[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14110.07, "timestamp": "03:55:10", "text": "不應該在那個方格里。我不知道。快死了。等等，他治療了嗎"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14113.03, "timestamp": "03:55:13", "text": "？餵。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14115.189, "timestamp": "03:55:15", "text": "我所有的努力都白費了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14136.63, "timestamp": "03:55:36", "text": "餵，我又落後四分鐘了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14139.59, "timestamp": "03:55:39", "text": "。著陸什麼的。我是在打惡夢版的亞當粉碎者嗎？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14144.55, "timestamp": "03:55:44", "text": "我想知道。是的，我在打。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14158.389, "timestamp": "03:55:58", "text": "告訴我。"}]